   "id": "85d8b7f9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Human pseudotime — CellRank RealTimeKernel → DPT **and** Palantir, from scratch\n",
    "\n",
    "Reproduces the chain in `fibdec_pseudotime_v2.ipynb` (moscot TemporalProblem → RealTimeKernel → dead-row repair →\n",
    "RTK-informed diffusion map → DPT) with your exact parameters, and adds **Palantir read off the same RTK graph** —\n",
    "so DPT and Palantir are two estimators on one time-informed geometry, directly comparable. A plain-kNN Palantir\n",
    "is kept as the control for \"what does the RTK buy\".\n",
    "\n",
    "**Input:** `data/deliverables/2026_08_28_Cevrim_Human_Only_Fib_Dec_Cells.h5ad` — the object's existing `X_scVI` is reused (`scvi_source = \"reuse\"`; no retraining). two phases → ONE moscot transition; the RTK bias is weak here (the provenance string on the object says so too), so expect RTK and plain-kNN results to be close.\n",
    "**Run on a GPU node** — moscot solves on JAX; `--gres=gpu:1 --mem 200G --cpus-per-task 8`, `rsc_uv`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Steps: load → day mapping → moscot → RTK (+repair) → RTK diffusion map → **you choose the root** (§5) → DPT + Palantir\n",
    "on the RTK graph (+ Palantir on plain kNN) → quantile normalisation → gates → violins (fill = median) → spatial.\n",
    "\n",
    "Conventions carried over: Palantir with `use_early_cell_as_start=True` (palantir 1.4.5 re-picks its own start\n",
    "otherwise); DC sign measured not assumed; wrong orientation **REFUSED, never flipped**; nothing writes to the object.\n",
    "The RTK step needs the object's expression matrix (moscot's marginal scoring), so unlike the \"loaded\" notebooks this\n",
    "one reads the full h5ad."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "29b301b5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "source: 2026_08_28_Cevrim_Human_Only_Fib_Dec_Cells.h5ad | exists: True\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import pathlib, json, warnings, time\n",
    "import numpy as np, pandas as pd, scanpy as sc, anndata as ad\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt, seaborn as sns\n",
    "from matplotlib.colors import Normalize\n",
    "from matplotlib.cm import ScalarMappable\n",
    "from scipy.stats import spearmanr\n",
    "from scipy.sparse import csr_matrix, issparse\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings(\"ignore\")\n",
    "\n",
    "X   = pathlib.Path(\"/n/lab_storage/eddy_lab/users/nhilgert/xmens_final\")\n",
    "SRC = X/\"data/deliverables/2026_08_28_Cevrim_Human_Only_Fib_Dec_Cells.h5ad\"\n",
    "ISO = X/\"results/isodepth/human_fibdec_isodepth.h5ad\"\n",
    "OUT = X/\"results/pseudotime_rtk/human\"; OUT.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# ---- parameters, verbatim from fibdec_pseudotime_v2.ipynb CONFIG ----\n",
    "CFG = dict(\n",
    "    moscot_gene_set=\"human\", moscot_epsilon=1e-3, moscot_tau_a=0.95, moscot_tau_b=0.95,\n",
    "    rtk_self_transitions=\"all\", rtk_conn_weight=0.2, rtk_threshold=\"auto\",\n",
    "    n_diffmap_comps=15, seed=0, latent=\"X_scVI\",\n",
    "    palantir_waypoints=1200, knn_control=30,\n",
    "    timepoint_to_day={\"secretory\": 0.0, \"menstrual\": 1.0},\n",
    ")\n",
    "SUBORDER = [\"endometrial_fibroblast\", \"decidual_cell\"]\n",
    "TPORDER  = [\"secretory\", \"menstrual\"]\n",
    "RANK, TPRANK = {s:i for i,s in enumerate(SUBORDER)}, {t:i for i,t in enumerate(TPORDER)}\n",
    "PAL  = dict(zip(SUBORDER, sns.color_palette(\"viridis\", len(SUBORDER))))\n",
    "TPAL = dict(zip(TPORDER,  sns.color_palette(\"rocket_r\", len(TPORDER))))\n",
    "\n",
    "CHECKS = []\n",
    "def verify(label, got, note=\"\"):\n",
    "    ok = bool(got); CHECKS.append((label, ok, str(got), note))\n",
    "    print((\"PASS  \" if ok else \"FAIL  \") + label + f\"   [{got}]\" + (f\"  {note}\" if note else \"\")); return ok\n",
    "print(\"source:\", SRC.name, \"| exists:\", SRC.exists())"
   ]
  },
